> basis p0 { g0(x) = ~x }
> basis p1 : p0 { g1(x) = ~x }
> basis p2 : p1 { g2(x) = ~x }
> basis p3 : p2 { g3(x) = ~x }
> f(x: bool) = ~x
> gates f basis p3
gates for f: 1 input bit -> 1 output bit, basis p3
  minimal: cost 1, 1 step (no program of cost <= 0 exists; 1 candidates searched)
  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 2 care inputs
  t0 = g0(x)                    = ~x
  r0 = t0
